; SLES01967
; Kagero - Deception II
; codes by bucanero, offsets from game-tools-collection save editor

:B?SLES-01967*

[INFO:Also select the checksum update code at the end of this list]

[LE:Max Ark 9,999,999]
2000091B 0098967F

[LE:Max Total Ark 9,999,999]
20000245 0098967F

[99 Clear Count]
00000269 00000063

[All Endings Seen]
set [b]:read(0x249,1)
set [b]:or:0F
write at 0x249:[b]

[Unlock All Traps]
